# Production build (Vercel): route PubChem through the bundled edge proxy at
# api/pug/[...path].ts. Requests then leave from Vercel's network instead of the
# visitor's, and successful responses are edge-cached for 24h. Local `npm run
# dev` ignores this file and calls PubChem directly.
VITE_PUBCHEM_PROXY=/api/pug
